    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Top Class Two Bedroom End Terrace Residence \n\nA Highly Desirable Town Residence\n\nKinsella Estates Gorey are delighted to bring to the market 48 Newborough, Gorey, an attractive and well-presented two-bedroom residence ideally situated in this highly sought-after development on the edge of Gorey Town.\n\nConstructed in 2002 and recently decorated to a high standard, the property is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers bright, comfortable and easily maintained accommodation extending to approximately 62.96 sq. m.\n\nThe property enjoys a superb location within easy reach of Gorey Town Centre and its wide range of shops, restaurants, cafés, schools and recreational amenities. With excellent transport connections also close at hand, the property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, those wishing to downsize or investors seeking a conveniently located residential property.\n\nA particular feature of the property is the enclosed south/East facing rear garden, complete with patio area, providing a private outdoor space ideal for relaxing and entertaining.\n \nInside: Elegant & Efficient Living\n\nGround Floor\nEntrance Hall: A welcoming entry with a warm timber floor, leading into the main living spaces.\nKitchen: Fitted with a tiled splashback and essential appliances, this area is designed for efficient, modern catering.\nSitting Room: A spacious and inviting heart of the home, featuring a beautiful timber fireplace as a focal point. The timber floor adds warmth, while the back door provides seamless access to the private patio, perfect for entertaining or quiet reflection.\n\nFirst Floor\nMaster Bedroom: A tranquil retreat benefiting from generous natural light\nBedroom: A well-proportioned second double bedroom, offering versatility for guests, a home office, or a children's room.\nBathroom: Newly Fully tiled, featuring a full suite.\n\nOutside: Low-Maintenance Lifestyle\nThe property boasts excellent outdoor spaces designed for ease and enjoyment:\n\nRear Garden: An enclosed back garden with a private patio area, ensuring maximum privacy and minimal maintenance, making it perfect for enjoying the outdoors without the fuss.\n\nFrontage: The property is an end-terrace, located at the end of a cul de sac overlooking the green area adding an extra layer of privacy and light, with a neat, easy-to-maintain approach.\n\nLocation & Connectivity\nNewborough is superbly situated on the edge of Gorey Town, granting residents immediate access to its renowned selection of boutique shops, gourmet dining, and leisure facilities.\n\nEducation: Within the catchment area of an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools. Commuter Links: An ideal location for commuters: Wexford Town: Approx. 30-minute drive. \n\nDublin Commute: Less than an hour's journey via the M11 motorway.\n\nBER: C 119917920 \nEir Code: Y25 A3A0\nHouse Size: (677 sq. ft) 62.92 mt. sq.\nFolio No: WX61044F\n\nServices:\n•Oil Fired Central Heating\n•Mains Sewerage\n•Mains Water\n\n\nFeatures:\n•Located on the edge of Gorey Town\n•Excellent choice of primary and secondary schools\n•Wexford Town 30-minute drive, Commute to Dublin just under the hour \n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nGround Floor:\n\nEntrance Hall:\nTimber Floor\nCoving\n\nKitchen: 2.4m x 2.8m\nTiled Splash Back\nTimber Floor \nChrome Vent\nNewly Quality Fitted Kitchen\n\nSitting Room: 4.5m x 4.2m\nFeature Timber Fireplace\nTimber Floor\nBack Door onto Patio Area\nCoving \nStorage Space under Stairs\n\nFirst Floor:\n\nMaster Bedroom: 3.3m x 2.5m\n\nBedroom 2: 3.6m x 2.8m\n\nShower room: 2.2m x 1.7m\nFully Tiled\nTriton Shower\n\nRear of Property \nEnclosed Back Yard\nPatio Area\nSouth East facing back garden\n\n\n"
      },
